                    <b>21 May 2025:</b> Advancing immersive learning across borders! 🌍📡<br><br>
                    We were proud to represent Altie Reality at <b>GITEX EUROPE 2025</b>, held in Berlin from May 21 to 23, where our Founder and CEO, Gaurav Purbia, joined high-level discussions on expanding XR in education across Europe, with a focus on Austria, Germany, and Malta. A special thanks to Maria Zammit Micallef from Malta Enterprise for her valuable insights on innovation and collaboration in the Maltese ecosystem. We also explored strategic synergies with <b>Supercharge.vc</b>, supporting our vision to scale LearnXR globally and make immersive education accessible worldwide.<br><br>
                    Pushing boundaries, building bridges — and shaping the future of learning in Europe. 🚀
                  </p>
