                </div>
                <h2 class="entry-title">
                  <a href="blog">The Future of Immersive Learning is Here</a>
                </h2>
                <div class="entry-content">
                  <p>
                    We're thrilled to announce that LearnXR Beta is now officially live on the Meta Quest Store — a significant milestone in our mission to revolutionize education using Extended Reality (XR) and Artificial Intelligence (AI). Designed for today's learners and tomorrow's challenges, LearnXR delivers interactive, self-paced, and curriculum-aligned learning experiences. From STEM subjects to history and beyond, students can now explore complex concepts in a hands-on, engaging way — no matter where they are. Available on Meta Quest 2 & 3, Android devices, and Cardboard VR, LearnXR is built to make immersive education accessible, inclusive, and impactful across Tier 1, Tier 2, and Tier 3 cities.<br><br>
                    This is just the beginning. Explore learning like never before — LearnXR Beta is now live on the Meta Quest Store!
                  </p>
                </div>
              </article>
            </section>

